5,0,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! This is going to be so exciting. Let's all try our best to find the werewolf!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's keep a cool head and observe everyone's behavior.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I hope we can reach a peaceful resolution.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready! I'll help everyone find the bad guy. Who do you guys think looks suspicious already?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is far too early for suspicions, Kenji. Let us first establish a baseline of how everyone communicates.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mio,,Benjamin is so serious! But you're right. Maybe we should just chat for a bit?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,That seems reasonable.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I find the silence between words often tells more than the words themselves.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"That sounds like something a mysterious person would say! @Jonathan, are you always this poetic?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"He is simply composed, Kenji. There is a difference between mystery and maturity.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mio,,I wonder who the Seer is. They must be feeling so pressured right now!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"If the Seer reveals themselves too early, they become a target. It is better to stay hidden.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Misaki is correct. Patience is a virtue in these circumstances.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,True! I'll be the Seer's best friend and protect them if I can!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A noble sentiment, though perhaps impractical given the rules of the game.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mio,,I'm just going to be my usual energetic self! Let's have a great game!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
