30,1,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
31,1,1,talk,Mio,,Good morning! I hope everyone slept well. Did anything interesting happen last night?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Nothing for us to know yet. We must look for inconsistencies in what people say today.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The morning air is crisp. However, I have a heavy feeling about one of us.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, what do you mean? Do you know something? Are you the Seer?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Kenji, please. Do not pressure people into revealing their roles immediately. It is tactically unsound.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Mio,,"But if Jonathan knows something, we should listen! Right, Jonathan?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, you seem very eager to push for a revelation. Why is that?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe it is time to be honest for the sake of the village. Mio is the werewolf.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Kenji,,What?! Mio? No way! She's way too cheerful to be a werewolf!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A surprising claim. @Jonathan, are you claiming the Seer role? If so, your certainty is quite bold.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm not the werewolf! Jonathan is lying! Why would you say that about me? I'm just Mio!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"The Seer's information is absolute. If Jonathan is the Seer, Mio must go.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I am the Seer. I divined Mio last night, and the result was clear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I don't want to believe it, but Jonathan seems so calm... he wouldn't lie, right?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic suggests that if Jonathan is lying, he is either the werewolf or the possessed. But his demeanor is consistent.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Mio,,Please believe me! I'm just a villager! Jonathan is trying to trick you all!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"Your desperation is noted, Mio. I trust Jonathan's word.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I am sorry it had to be you, Mio.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'll trust the Seer. Sorry, Mio!","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,The evidence provided by the claimed Seer is the most reliable lead we have. I concur.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
